You can further chain or append your extracted modifier chains by calling the .then() function:

val reusableModifier = Modifier
    .fillMaxWidth()
    .background(Color.Red)
    .padding(12.dp)

// Append to your reusableModifier
reusableModifier.clickable { /*...*/ }

